H(/^tip:change this wild spot character/i, '✏️ Change', 'Opens this wild spot character to change it.');
H(/^tip:remove this wild spot character/i, '✕ Remove', 'Removes this wild spot character. With none, the wild spots get random characters.');
H(/^tip:what the wild spots look like as characters/i, '🎨 Wild spot characters', 'What the wild spots look like in battles with 🧍 characters: make one or more characters; the spots wear them in order.');
H(/^tip:make the characters the wild spots wear/i, '🎨 Wild spot characters', 'Make the characters the wild spots wear in battles with 🧍 characters. The 1st wild spot wears character 1, the 2nd character 2, and so on. None = random characters.');
H(/^tip:a practice battle with characters where the first pieces are wild spots/i, '🎟️ Practice battle with wild spots', 'A practice battle with characters: the first few pieces are wild spots wearing your wild spot characters.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:pick a themed map to see everyone dressed for it/i, '🗺️ Themed map', 'Pick a themed map (Battlefield, Rumble Royal, Deep Space…) to see the random characters dressed for it.', ['test']);
